#. Description of the plugin
#: rrze-statistik.php
msgid ""
"Displays monthly statistics from https://statistiken.rrze.fau.de within your "
"Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt monatliche Statistiken von https://statistiken.rrze.fau.de auf Ihrem "
"Dashboard an."

#. Author of the plugin
#: rrze-statistik.php
msgid "RRZE Webteam"
msgstr "RRZE Webteam"

